{"id":"mtk-02b-bandingkan-pecahan-campur","type":"subbab","subject":"mtk","chapter":"mtk-02","subBab":"mtk-02b","slug":"bandingkan-pecahan","tier":"campur","title":"OSN SD · MTK · Sub-bab MTK-02b · Membandingkan & Mengurutkan Pecahan","theory":[{"title":"A. Konsep Dasar & Definisi","content":"**Pecahan** adalah bilangan yang menyatakan bagian dari satu utuh. Dituliskan sebagai a/b — dengan a disebut **pembilang** (jumlah bagian yang dihitung) dan b disebut **penyebut** (banyaknya bagian yang membagi satu utuh). Penyebut tidak boleh 0.\n\n**Membandingkan dua pecahan** berarti memutuskan tanda di antara keduanya: \">\" (lebih besar), \"<\" (lebih kecil), atau \"=\" (sama nilai). **Mengurutkan** berarti menyusun beberapa pecahan dari yang terkecil ke terbesar (urut naik) atau sebaliknya (urut turun).\n\nTantangan utama saat membandingkan pecahan adalah: pecahan dengan **angka lebih besar belum tentu lebih besar nilainya**. Contoh: 1/100 jauh lebih kecil dari 1/2 — padahal \"100\" terlihat besar. Penyebut 100 justru membagi 1 utuh menjadi 100 bagian kecil, jadi tiap bagian sangat tipis. Inilah miskonsepsi terbesar di sub-bab ini: anak sering tertipu oleh penyebut besar.\n\nUntuk membandingkan dengan benar, kita perlu **strategi**, bukan tebakan. Ada **lima strategi standar** yang dipakai di OSN SD: (1) jika penyebut sama, bandingkan pembilang; (2) jika pembilang sama, bandingkan penyebut (kebalikannya); (3) samakan penyebut pakai KPK lalu bandingkan; (4) kali silang dua pecahan; (5) konversi ke desimal lalu bandingkan biasa. Strategi mana yang terbaik bergantung pada bentuk soal.\n\nPecahan yang akan dibandingkan tidak harus berbentuk pecahan biasa. **Pecahan campuran** (mis. 2 1/3), **desimal** (mis. 0,75), dan **persen** (mis. 60 %) semuanya bisa dibandingkan, asal kita ubah ke bentuk yang seragam. Itu sebabnya konversi antar-bentuk sering muncul di soal Provinsi & Nasional."},{"title":"Strategi 1 — Penyebut sama → bandingkan pembilang","content":"Jika **penyebutnya sama**, pembilang yang lebih besar = pecahan yang lebih besar.\n\nContoh: 3/7 vs 5/7 → karena penyebut sama, lihat pembilang. 5 > 3 → **5/7 > 3/7**."},{"title":"Strategi 2 — Pembilang sama → bandingkan penyebut (kebalikan!)","content":"Jika **pembilangnya sama**, **penyebut yang lebih kecil** = pecahan yang **lebih besar**. (Karena satu utuh dibagi lebih sedikit bagian, tiap bagiannya lebih besar.)\n\nContoh: 2/5 vs 2/9 → pembilang sama (2). Penyebut 5 < 9 → **2/5 > 2/9**.\n\nIngat: aturan \"penyebut kecil = lebih besar\" hanya berlaku saat pembilangnya sama."},{"title":"Strategi 3 — Samakan penyebut pakai KPK","content":"Cari **KPK (Kelipatan Persekutuan Terkecil)** dari kedua penyebut. Ubah kedua pecahan ke penyebut KPK itu. Lalu bandingkan pembilangnya (kembali ke Strategi 1).\n\nContoh: 2/3 vs 3/5. KPK(3,5) = 15. → 2/3 = 10/15, 3/5 = 9/15. Karena 10 > 9 → **2/3 > 3/5**."},{"title":"Strategi 4 — Perkalian silang","content":"Bandingkan a/b dengan c/d → hitung **a × d** dan **b × c**, lalu bandingkan dua hasilnya.\n\n- Jika a × d > b × c → a/b > c/d\n- Jika a × d < b × c → a/b < c/d\n- Jika a × d = b × c → a/b = c/d (senilai)\n\nContoh: 4/7 vs 3/5. → 4 × 5 = 20 vs 7 × 3 = 21. 20 < 21 → **4/7 < 3/5**.\n\n> **Catatan:** Strategi 4 hanya untuk dua pecahan. Untuk tiga atau lebih pecahan, lebih aman pakai Strategi 3 (samakan penyebut semuanya)."},{"title":"Strategi 5 — Konversi ke desimal","content":"Ubah tiap pecahan ke desimal (pembagian pembilang ÷ penyebut), lalu bandingkan desimal seperti biasa.\n\nContoh: 5/8 vs 7/12. → 5/8 = 0,625; 7/12 ≈ 0,583. 0,625 > 0,583 → **5/8 > 7/12**.\n\nStrategi 5 sangat berguna saat soal mencampur pecahan biasa, desimal, persen, dan pecahan campuran."},{"title":"Pecahan & 1 utuh","content":"- Pecahan **a/b** dengan a < b disebut **pecahan biasa** (nilainya < 1). Contoh: 3/4, 5/8.\n- Pecahan **a/b** dengan a = b sama dengan **1**. Contoh: 5/5 = 1.\n- Pecahan **a/b** dengan a > b disebut **pecahan tidak biasa** (nilainya > 1). Contoh: 7/4 = 1,75."},{"title":"Pecahan campuran ↔ pecahan biasa","content":"- Pecahan campuran: c a/b = c + a/b. Contoh: 2 1/3 = 2 + 1/3 = 7/3.\n- Untuk membandingkan pecahan campuran, **bandingkan bagian bulatnya dulu**. Jika sama, baru bandingkan bagian pecahannya.\n\nContoh: 2 1/4 vs 3 1/8 → bagian bulat 2 vs 3, jelas 3 > 2, jadi **3 1/8 > 2 1/4**. Tidak perlu hitung lebih jauh."},{"title":"Pecahan & desimal","content":"- 1/2 = 0,5 = 50 %\n- 1/4 = 0,25 = 25 %\n- 3/4 = 0,75 = 75 %\n- 1/5 = 0,2 = 20 %\n- 1/8 = 0,125 = 12,5 %\n- 1/10 = 0,1 = 10 %\n- 1/3 ≈ 0,333…\n- 2/3 ≈ 0,666…\n\nHafalkan tabel ini — sangat menghemat waktu saat membandingkan campuran bentuk."},{"title":"Pecahan negatif (untuk soal Nas/lanjutan)","content":"Pada bilangan negatif, **yang lebih dekat ke nol lebih besar**. Jadi −1/4 > −1/2 (karena −1/4 lebih dekat ke 0). Awas: anak sering kebalik di sini."},{"title":"D. Miskonsepsi yang Sering Muncul","content":"1. **\"Penyebut besar berarti nilai besar.\"** SALAH. Justru sebaliknya saat pembilangnya sama. 1/100 < 1/2.\n2. **\"Bandingkan pembilang saja, abaikan penyebut.\"** SALAH. 3/4 vs 5/8 → 5 > 3, tapi 3/4 = 6/8 > 5/8.\n3. **\"Saling tukar penyebut lalu jumlah.\"** Bukan strategi banding. Ini bahkan bukan operasi yang valid.\n4. **Salah hitung KPK** — sering ambil hasil kali dua penyebut padahal bisa lebih kecil. Contoh: KPK(6,9) = 18, bukan 54.\n5. **Lupa \"kebalikan\" saat membandingkan pecahan negatif** — −1/2 dianggap > −1/4 karena \"2 lebih besar dari 4\". Salah.\n6. **Salah arah saat perkalian silang** — bingung mana a×d dan b×c, lalu menyimpulkan terbalik.\n7. **Membandingkan pecahan campuran lewat bagian pecahannya dulu** — padahal bagian bulatnya harus jadi penentu utama.\n8. **Menganggap pecahan dan desimal \"tidak bisa\" dibandingkan langsung** — padahal bisa, lewat konversi."},{"title":"Contoh 1 — Penyebut sama","content":"**Soal:** Bandingkan 5/9 dan 7/9.\n**Jawab:** Penyebut sama (9). Pembilang 7 > 5. Jadi **7/9 > 5/9**."},{"title":"Contoh 2 — Pembilang sama","content":"**Soal:** Bandingkan 4/7 dan 4/11.\n**Jawab:** Pembilang sama (4). Penyebut 7 < 11, jadi tiap bagiannya lebih besar → **4/7 > 4/11**."},{"title":"Contoh 3 — Penyebut beda, samakan penyebut","content":"**Soal:** Bandingkan 3/4 dan 5/6.\n**Jawab:** KPK(4,6) = 12. 3/4 = 9/12; 5/6 = 10/12. Karena 10 > 9 → **5/6 > 3/4**."},{"title":"Contoh 4 — Perkalian silang","content":"**Soal:** Bandingkan 7/9 dan 5/6.\n**Jawab:** 7 × 6 = 42; 9 × 5 = 45. 42 < 45 → **7/9 < 5/6**."},{"title":"Contoh 5 — Urutkan 3 pecahan","content":"**Soal:** Urutkan dari terkecil: 1/2, 2/3, 3/5.\n**Jawab:** KPK(2,3,5) = 30. 1/2 = 15/30; 2/3 = 20/30; 3/5 = 18/30. Urut: 15 < 18 < 20 → **1/2 < 3/5 < 2/3**."},{"title":"Contoh 6 — Campur bentuk","content":"**Soal:** Urutkan dari terbesar: 0,6 ; 3/5 ; 65 %.\n**Jawab:** Ubah ke desimal. 0,6; 3/5 = 0,6; 65 % = 0,65. Urut: 0,65 > 0,6 = 0,6 → **65 % > 0,6 = 3/5**."},{"title":"Contoh 7 — Soal cerita","content":"**Soal:** Ibu memotong dua kue ulang tahun yang sama besar. Kue cokelat dipotong jadi 8 bagian sama dan diambil 3 bagian. Kue keju dipotong jadi 12 bagian sama dan diambil 5 bagian. Mana yang diambil lebih banyak?\n**Jawab:** Cokelat: 3/8 = 9/24. Keju: 5/12 = 10/24. 10/24 > 9/24 → **kue keju yang diambil lebih banyak**."},{"title":"Contoh 8 — Pecahan campuran","content":"**Soal:** Bandingkan 2 3/4 dan 2 7/10.\n**Jawab:** Bagian bulat sama (2). Bandingkan 3/4 vs 7/10. Samakan penyebut KPK(4,10)=20. 3/4 = 15/20; 7/10 = 14/20. 15 > 14 → **2 3/4 > 2 7/10**.\n\n---"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Penyebut dari dua pecahan sama. Manakah pernyataan yang benar?","options":{"A":"Pecahan dengan pembilang lebih besar bernilai lebih besar.","B":"Pecahan dengan pembilang lebih kecil bernilai lebih besar.","C":"Kedua pecahan pasti senilai.","D":"Tidak bisa dibandingkan tanpa mengubah penyebut."},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":2,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Manakah yang benar?","options":{"A":"4/9 > 5/9","B":"4/9 = 5/9","C":"4/9 < 5/9","D":"Tidak bisa dibandingkan"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":3,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Jika pembilang dua pecahan sama, pecahan dengan penyebut yang ___ bernilai lebih besar.","options":{"A":"lebih besar","B":"lebih kecil","C":"sama dengan pembilangnya","D":"selalu genap"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":4,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 3/8 dan 3/5.","options":{"A":"3/8 > 3/5","B":"3/8 < 3/5","C":"3/8 = 3/5","D":"Bergantung pada konteks"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":5,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 1/2 dan 3/6.","options":{"A":"1/2 > 3/6","B":"1/2 < 3/6","C":"1/2 = 3/6","D":"Tidak dapat ditentukan"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":6,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Manakah pecahan terbesar di antara: 2/7, 3/7, 5/7, 6/7?","options":{"A":"2/7","B":"3/7","C":"5/7","D":"6/7"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":7,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Manakah pecahan terkecil di antara: 1/3, 1/5, 1/6, 1/9?","options":{"A":"1/3","B":"1/5","C":"1/6","D":"1/9"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":8,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 2/3 dan 3/4 dengan strategi KPK.","options":{"A":"2/3 > 3/4","B":"2/3 < 3/4","C":"2/3 = 3/4","D":"Tidak bisa pakai KPK"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":9,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"KPK dari 6 dan 8 adalah ...","options":{"A":"14","B":"24","C":"48","D":"16"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":10,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 5/6 dan 7/9 dengan menyamakan penyebut.","options":{"A":"5/6 > 7/9","B":"5/6 < 7/9","C":"5/6 = 7/9","D":"Tidak ada KPK"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":11,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Pakai perkalian silang: 3/4 vs 5/7. Hitung 3 × 7 = ___ dan 4 × 5 = ___.","options":{"A":"21 dan 20 → 3/4 > 5/7","B":"21 dan 20 → 3/4 < 5/7","C":"20 dan 21 → 3/4 > 5/7","D":"20 dan 21 → 3/4 < 5/7"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":12,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Pakai perkalian silang: 2/5 vs 3/8. Tentukan tandanya.","options":{"A":"2/5 > 3/8","B":"2/5 < 3/8","C":"2/5 = 3/8","D":"Tidak bisa disilang"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":13,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk desimal dari 3/4 adalah ...","options":{"A":"0,34","B":"0,75","C":"0,43","D":"0,57"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":14,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk desimal dari 2/5 adalah ...","options":{"A":"0,4","B":"0,25","C":"2,5","D":"0,52"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":15,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 1/2 dan 0,4.","options":{"A":"1/2 > 0,4","B":"1/2 < 0,4","C":"1/2 = 0,4","D":"Tidak bisa dibandingkan beda bentuk"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":16,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Urutkan dari yang terkecil: 2/7, 5/7, 3/7, 1/7.","options":{"A":"1/7, 2/7, 3/7, 5/7","B":"5/7, 3/7, 2/7, 1/7","C":"1/7, 3/7, 2/7, 5/7","D":"2/7, 1/7, 3/7, 5/7"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":17,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Urutkan dari yang terbesar: 1/3, 1/8, 1/5, 1/12.","options":{"A":"1/3, 1/5, 1/8, 1/12","B":"1/12, 1/8, 1/5, 1/3","C":"1/3, 1/8, 1/5, 1/12","D":"1/12, 1/5, 1/8, 1/3"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":18,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 4/9 dan 5/12 dengan perkalian silang.","options":{"A":"4/9 > 5/12","B":"4/9 < 5/12","C":"4/9 = 5/12","D":"Tidak ada hubungannya"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":19,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 6/10 dan 3/5.","options":{"A":"6/10 > 3/5","B":"6/10 < 3/5","C":"6/10 = 3/5","D":"Tidak ada hubungan"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":20,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bandingkan 7/10 dan 3/4.","options":{"A":"7/10 > 3/4","B":"7/10 < 3/4","C":"7/10 = 3/4","D":"Tidak ada KPK"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":21,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Manakah pecahan terbesar?","options":{"A":"1/2","B":"2/3","C":"3/4","D":"4/5"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":22,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Manakah pecahan terkecil?","options":{"A":"5/12","B":"1/3","C":"7/24","D":"5/8"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":23,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Mana yang setara dengan 1/2?","options":{"A":"3/5","B":"4/8","C":"5/9","D":"6/13"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":24,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Mana yang setara dengan 3/4?","options":{"A":"6/9","B":"9/12","C":"7/10","D":"15/24"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":25,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Pak Budi punya kebun. 2/5 ditanami jagung dan 3/8 ditanami padi. Bagian mana yang lebih luas?","options":{"A":"Jagung","B":"Padi","C":"Sama luas","D":"Tidak bisa dibandingkan"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":26,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Tiga pita panjangnya 1/2 m, 3/4 m, dan 5/8 m. Pita terpanjang adalah ...","options":{"A":"1/2 m","B":"3/4 m","C":"5/8 m","D":"Sama panjang"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":27,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Urutkan dari yang terkecil: 1/2, 2/3, 3/5.","options":{"A":"1/2, 3/5, 2/3","B":"3/5, 1/2, 2/3","C":"2/3, 3/5, 1/2","D":"1/2, 2/3, 3/5"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":28,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Urutkan dari yang terbesar: 5/6, 7/8, 11/12.","options":{"A":"5/6, 7/8, 11/12","B":"11/12, 7/8, 5/6","C":"7/8, 11/12, 5/6","D":"5/6, 11/12, 7/8"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":29,"subTopic":"Tingkat Kabupaten (Soal 1","level":"